What will be the output of the following Java code?

```java
class A {
    int a = 5;
    public int getA() {
        return a;
    }
} //class A
class B extends A {
    private int a = 6;
    public void rollBackA() {
        a++;
        a = super.getA();
    }
} //class B
public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        A objA = new A();
        B objB = new B();
        objB.rollBackA();
        System.out.format("%d, %d%n", objA.getA(), objB.getA());
    }
}
```

